    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual horror game,\u00a0similar to a haunted attraction, with an emphasis on jumpscare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is explore the mysterious house, and find 50 jumpscares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The type and location of jumpscares change randomly each time, and there are over 100 different types, from simple to hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all the jumpscares and escape from this house of terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like horror games but don't like jumpscares, try this game to improve your tolerance for surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also has a mode that shows a warning shortly before a scare occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains loud sounds and scare scenes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you feel tired while playing, take a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We cannot be responsible for any problems caused by playing this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Streaming and uploading video</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play this game live or upload videos at your own risk, and monetize those videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, I would appreciate it if you could include a link to your store page in the description section</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual horror game,\u00a0similar to a haunted attraction, with an emphasis on jumpscare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is explore the mysterious house, and find 50 jumpscares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The type and location of jumpscares change randomly each time, and there are over 100 different types, from simple to hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all the jumpscares and escape from this house of terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like horror games but don't like jumpscares, try this game to improve your tolerance for surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also has a mode that shows a warning shortly before a scare occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains loud sounds and scare scenes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you feel tired while playing, take a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We cannot be responsible for any problems caused by playing this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Streaming and uploading video</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play this game live or upload videos at your own risk, and monetize those videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, I would appreciate it if you could include a link to your store page in the description section</p>",
